  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n{5 - 5 ÷ (10 - 12) × 8 + 9} × 3 + 5 + 5 × 5 ÷ 5 of 5\n\n**Concept used:**\n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/35004a8cde507f577415a069047f84c88df87c3527c950d19e130ffe661718e1.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n{5 - 5 ÷ (10 - 12) × 8 + 9} × 3 + 5 + 5 × 5 ÷ 5 of 5\n\n⇒ {5 – 5 ÷ (- 2) × 8 + 9} × 3 + 5 + 5 × 5 ÷ 5 of 5\n\n⇒ {5 + (5/2) × 8 + 9} × 3 + 5 + 5 × 5 ÷ 5 of 5\n\n⇒ {5 + 20 + 9} × 3 + 5 + 5 × 5 ÷ 5 of 5\n\n⇒ 34 × 3 + 5 + 5 × 5 ÷ 25\n\n⇒ 34 × 3 + 5 + 1\n\n⇒ 102 + 5 + 1\n\n⇒ **108**",
